-- ============================================================
-- Alonecraft 4.61 -- Rogue / Subtlety, part 1 of 6
--   Feint            -> parry instead of threat
--   Sleight of Hand  -> reduced chance to be hit + stronger Feint
--   Filthy Tricks    -> Evasion/Feint cooldown instead of Preparation
-- ============================================================
--
-- TODO.md:
--   "Feint: Threat no longer affected. Instead increases your chance to
--    parry (basically a spare Evasion)."
--   "Sleight of Hand: Reduces your chance to be hit by melee and ranged
--    attacks by 3/6% and increases the parry chance of your Feint ability
--    by 20/40%."
--   "Filthy Tricks: Preparation cooldown reduction removed, replaced with
--    Evasion and Feint cooldown reduction."
--
--
-- FEINT (1966, 6768, 8637, 11303, 25302, 27448, 48658, 48659)
--
--   Effect1 was SPELL_EFFECT_REDUCE_THREAT_PERCENT (63) with an enemy
--   target (EffectImplicitTargetA1 = 6).  It becomes APPLY_AURA ->
--   SPELL_AURA_MOD_PARRY_PERCENT (47) on the caster (target 1), so Feint
--   no longer needs a target at all.
--
--   Three traps, all of which silently break the buff if missed:
--     * Ranks 1-7 have DurationIndex 0 -- the threat effect was instant.
--       An aura with no duration never applies.  All ranks get index 8
--       (15 s), the same as Evasion rank 1.
--     * EffectRealPointsPerLevel1 was -1 (the threat amount grew with
--       level).  Left alone it would shrink the parry value every level.
--       Zeroed on every rank.
--     * $s1 renders BasePoints + max(1, DieSides), so BasePoints is the
--       displayed value minus one.  DieSides stays 1.
--
--   Parry per rank ramps 20 -> 50%, landing on Evasion's 50% at rank 8
--   ("basically a spare Evasion").  Rank 8 keeps its Effect2 AoE damage
--   avoidance; that effect's duration rides the same 15 s index.
--
--
-- SLEIGHT OF HAND (30892, 30893)
--
--   Effect1 is already ADD_PCT_MODIFIER with EffectMiscValue 8
--   (SPELLMOD_ALL_EFFECTS) masked to Feint (word A 134217728), so it
--   already scales whatever Feint's effects are -- only the magnitude
--   changes, 10/20% -> 20/40%.  No aura or mask edit needed.
--
--   Effect2/Effect3 were MOD_ATTACKER_MELEE_CRIT_CHANCE (187) and
--   MOD_ATTACKER_RANGED_CRIT_CHANCE (188) at -2/-3%.  They become
--   MOD_ATTACKER_MELEE_HIT_CHANCE (184) and
--   MOD_ATTACKER_RANGED_HIT_CHANCE (185) at -3/-6%.
--
--   Sleight of Hand ships stale class masks on effects 2 and 3 (word A of
--   both = 134217728, copied from effect 1).  Those words are zeroed --
--   attacker-hit auras are not spell modifiers and must not carry a mask.
--
--
-- FILTHY TRICKS (58414, 58415)
--
--   Effect2 was SPELLMOD_COOLDOWN -90/-180 s masked to Preparation
--   (effect-2 word B = 4096).  Preparation is being rebuilt as Bladework
--   (see part 6) and an 8-minute cooldown reduction is meaningless on a
--   30 s ability, so the effect is retargeted to Evasion (word A 32) and
--   Feint (word A 134217728) -> mask word A = 134217760, at -30/-60 s.
--
--   Effects 1 and 3 (Distract / Shadowstep / Tricks of the Trade cooldown
--   and cost) are untouched.
--
--   CLASS-MASK COLUMN TRAP: EffectSpellClassMask{X}{n} is effect X, word n
--   -- so effect 2's three words are B1/B2/B3, not A2/B2/C2.  All three of
--   effect 2's words are rewritten below so the old Preparation bit in B2
--   cannot survive.
--
-- ============================================================


